raw_json:
{"skill": "Function of Sentence", "difficulty": "Easy", "question": "The following text is adapted from a scientific discussion about the behavior of certain birds.

Birds of the genus Cardinalis are known for their striking red plumage and bold behaviors. _One interesting behavior observed in these birds is their tendency to defend their territory with vigorous displays against potential competitors._ Such displays serve as a mechanism to avoid physical confrontations and signal their status to rivals.

Which choice best describes the function of the _underlined_ sentence in the text as a whole?", "choices": ["A) It illustrates a specific characteristic of the genus Cardinalis.", "B) It introduces a benefit of the birds' territorial behavior.", "C) It describes why these birds' plumage is an important trait.", "D) It explains the role of vocalizations in communication among these birds."], "answer": "A", "explanation": "The underlined sentence elaborates on the bold behaviors of Cardinalis birds by providing a specific example of their actions when defending territory. This supports Choice A as it illustrates a defining behavior. Choice B is incorrect because it does not focus on the benefits but describes the behavior itself. Choice C is incorrect as it is unrelated to the underlined sentence's focus. Choice D is incorrect because the underlined sentence does not address vocalizations but rather physical displays."}

